.TH WERKMEISTER-REMOVE 1 "" "werkmeister" "Werkmeister Manual"
.SH NAME
werkmeister\-remove \- Stop a local service, fall back to k8s
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwerkmeister remove\fR <feature> <service>
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Removes the service from the feature's local stack. The service will now be served from k8s. Config files are regenerated and Caddy is reloaded.
.PP
If removing the last service, the feature's containers are fully stopped (though the slot remains allocated — use \fBwerkmeister down\fR to release it).
.PP
.nf
.RS 4
werkmeister remove my\-feature frontend
.RE
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBwerkmeister\fR(1)
